              "instruction": "ñān kattŭ vaḻiyile tapālppeṭṭiyil iṭṭu. — I dropped the letter into the post box on the road.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ñān kattŭ vaḻiyile tapālppeṭṭiyil iṭṭu.* — I dropped the letter into the post box on the road.]"
